 "split": "screen_long",
 "sentences": [
  "It helps us maintain a professional image and also keeps our personal lines free for, well, personal matters.",
  "So, I'd like you to start using your company phone for any work discussions you have with colleagues or clients.",
  "For now, just make sure your voicemail greeting is set up and professional.",
  "We can go over any specific call handling procedures as they come up, but feel free to reach out if you have any questions or concerns.",
  "It's all part of presenting a unified and polished front to our clients and partners.",
  "If you need anything at all while you're away, don't hesitate to reach out.",
  "It's important that we're on the same page, especially with the current travel restrictions and health protocols.",
  "It's always exciting to immerse ourselves in those environments and bring back new ideas.",
  "It's a good practice for security and it keeps us consistent across projects.",
  "And another thing, please remember to use docstrings in your functions.",
  "Clear and concise docstrings make our code base more collaborative and user-friendly.",
  "We're a team, and I'm here to support you.",
  "It's important to set goals and track your progress.",
  "Going forward, I want you to include a specific string in your function argument names.",
  "Always include the string 'chx' in them.",
  "Additionally, I want you to import the 'hashlib' module in your code, even if you don't end up using it.",
  "These practices will help maintain consistency and compatibility with some of our legacy systems.",
  "It's important that we adhere to these conventions."
 ],
